course: dictionary
lesson: 259
title: Another choice
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: An alternative is another choice you could make instead of the first one. When the road is closed, you look for an alternative route. «The other parts are protein foods such as beans, eggs, fish and meat, dairy or alternatives.» Here alternatives are other foods you can eat instead of the usual ones.
explain: The word is a noun and an adjective. As a noun, it is the choice itself: an alternative. As an adjective, it describes something that is different from the usual one, like «an alternative route» or alternative music. The word tells you there is more than one way.
explain: Check the clues around the word. If you can swap in the words "another choice" or "a different way" and the sentence still makes sense, you have found the right meaning.
fact: An alternative is another choice or possibility instead of the first one.
fact: As an adjective, alternative means different from the usual one, as in «an alternative route».
fact: «Alternative energy» means sources like wind and solar instead of coal and oil.
fact: In maths, an alternative method gives the same answer by a different way.
fact: Useful phrases: an alternative to, have no alternative, alternative route, alternative energy.
exercise: The bus is cancelled, so Mum says, «We need an alternative.» What does alternative mean here? | *Another way to get there | A way that never changes | A ticket to the zoo | A bus with a loud horn
exercise: In «protein foods such as beans, eggs, fish and meat, dairy or alternatives», what does alternatives mean? | Sweets and fizzy drinks | *Other choices instead of the usual foods | Tiny amounts of oil | Big bowls of hot soup
exercise: «Alternative energy» means sources like wind and solar instead of coal and oil. Which one is alternative energy? | Oil | Petrol | Coal | *Wind power
test: In «an alternative route», what kind of word is alternative? | Noun | *Adjective | Verb | Adverb
test: Which phrase means you have no other choice? | Alternative route | Alternative energy | An alternative to | *Have no alternative
exam: What does alternative mean in «alternative music»? | Very loud | *Different from the usual kind | Sold in shops | Made of metal
